@startuml
title Decentralized Compute Marketplace - Job Lifecycle

actor Consumer

participant "Consumer App" as App
participant "Job Smart Contract" as Contract

participant "Provider A App" as P1
participant "Provider B App" as P2
participant "Provider C App" as P3

participant "Container A" as C1
participant "Container B" as C2
participant "Container C" as C3

database "Distributed Storage" as Storage


== Job Creation ==

Consumer -> App : Create job
App -> Storage : Upload input
Storage --> App : Input reference / hash

App -> Contract : createJob(inputHash, requirements)\n+ escrow payment

Contract --> App : Job created / OPEN


== Provider Participation ==

P1 -> Contract : Claim job
P2 -> Contract : Claim job
P3 -> Contract : Claim job

Contract --> P1 : Claim accepted
Contract --> P2 : Claim accepted
Contract --> P3 : Claim accepted


== Independent Execution ==

P1 -> Storage : Download input
Storage --> P1 : Input

P2 -> Storage : Download input
Storage --> P2 : Input

P3 -> Storage : Download input
Storage --> P3 : Input

P1 -> C1 : Execute job
P2 -> C2 : Execute job
P3 -> C3 : Execute job

C1 --> P1 : Result A
C2 --> P2 : Result B
C3 --> P3 : Result C


== Commit Phase ==

P1 -> Contract : commit(hash(Result A + nonce A))
P2 -> Contract : commit(hash(Result B + nonce B))
P3 -> Contract : commit(hash(Result C + nonce C))

Contract -> Contract : Close commit phase


== Reveal Phase ==

P1 -> Contract : reveal(Result A, nonce A)
P2 -> Contract : reveal(Result B, nonce B)
P3 -> Contract : reveal(Result C, nonce C)

Contract -> Contract : Verify commitments
Contract -> Contract : Compare results


== Verification ==

alt Majority agreement

    Contract -> Contract : Accept majority result

    P1 -> Storage : Upload result
    P2 -> Storage : Upload result

    Contract --> P1 : Release payment
    Contract --> P2 : Release payment

    Contract --> P3 : Penalize / slash stake

    Contract --> App : Verification complete\n+ verified result hash

    App -> Storage : Retrieve verified result
    Storage --> App : Verified result

else No majority

    Contract -> Contract : Enter disputed state
    Contract -> Contract : Request additional providers

end

@enduml
